Lyntin is not the most user-friendly mud client in the world in the
sense that everything is oriented towards the command line interface.

The "#session" command will allow you to start a session.  When you're
done, "#end" will close Lyntin.

Type "#help <command>" for help on commands.  These will be of
interest to you.

   action               alias
   end                  gag
   highlight            session

category: general
